# C1 copy: checks that the C2v blocking does not change the spectrum
# H2O aug-cc-pVDZ, frozen O 1s: the integrals of the ADC(2,2) oracle (ADC22.H2O.tar.bz2,
# MOLCAS SEWARD/SCF/MOTRA + Prema's 1h-ADC(2,2), variant F, one run per C2v irrep)
&geometry
  file   h2o.xyz
  unit   angstrom
&basis
  name   aug-cc-pvdz
&scf
  charge 0
  spin   0
  symmetry off
  gate   -76.0413935200
  max_cycle 200
&active
  frozen-core 1
&output
  fcidump  h2o_c1.fcidump
  sidecar  h2o_c1.mo.json
  manifest h2o_c1.ref.json
